# =====================================================================
# BUY & BYE — Monorepo Root .gitignore
# Prevents accidental upload of confidential files, databases, and secrets
# =====================================================================

# 1. Confidential Database Dumps & Schemas (Contains plain-text passwords & salaries)
buynbye_db2.sql
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
**/data/store.json
**/data/*.json

# 2. Environment Variables & Credentials (CRITICAL: Do not upload .env)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# 3. Dependencies & Build Artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# 4. Backend & Redundant Directories (Web Apps only)
buyandbye-backend/
my-react-app/
Images/

# 5. Loose Root Assets & Temporary Files
banner.png
Buy_and_Bye_Logo_Transparent_v2.png
character.png
designchange.jpeg
favicon.png
index.html
package-lock.json

# 6. Logs & Tool Cache
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.oxlintcache

# 7. Operating System & Editor Files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
